+---
+name: visual-question-answering
+description: Answering a question about an image with a Python code interpreter available.
+---
+
+# Visual question answering
+
+Answer the question about the image. Look at the image carefully before deciding, use the
+code interpreter when a measurement would settle the question, and put the final answer
+inside `<answer></answer>` tags.
+
+## Workflow
+
+1. Read the question and decide what has to be true of the image for each answer.
+2. Inspect the image; measure with code when the eye is unreliable.
+3. Commit to one answer and write it inside `<answer></answer>`.
